# .vercelignore — spec 223: stop serving the repo's internals on
# www.defi.garden.
#
# THE ALLOWLIST HALF IS LOAD-BEARING. This file is a denylist, but the thing
# it must never break is everything NOT listed here: home.html, plan.html,
# every app bundle + .min/.compiled twin, all CSS, data/, tokens/, chains/,
# ko/, pools/ (the item-212 markdown twins — pools/*.md, tokens/*.md,
# chains/*.md, ko/**/*.md are a LIVE runtime feature, never touch them),
# stories/, spotlights/, sitemap*.xml, llms*.txt, robots.txt, og/ + og-image.png,
# fonts/, tools/, status, the domain-verification .txt file, and
# all of .well-known/ (including its .md/.py/.js/template files — agent-skills
# discovery depends on serving those as static files, not just JSON).
#
# WHEN IN DOUBT ABOUT A FILE, KEEP SERVING IT. Every pattern below is anchored
# (leading `/`) so a root-level name can never accidentally shadow a nested
# runtime file of the same name (e.g. `/CLAUDE.md` must not match a
# hypothetical `tokens/CLAUDE.md`). No `!` negations are used anywhere, by
# design (Vercel's negation handling is unreliable) — every pattern here is
# written precise enough that none is needed.
#
# Gate: test_vercelignore.js parses this file and asserts both the
# must-keep and must-exclude sets against the real `git ls-files` output,
# plus a link-integrity scan so a mis-enumeration here fails loudly in CI
# before it ever reaches a deploy.

# --- dev/test/tooling scripts (root only) -----------------------------------
/test_*.js
/run-tests.js
/audit-app.js
/compile-app.js
/minify-assets.js
/generate-*.js
/validate-sitemaps.js
/indexnow-ping.js
/languages.js
/compute-kpis.js
# Scoring / forecast engine and anything that documents its internals. The DeFi
# Score is PROPRIETARY (owner decision 2026-10-25, "what, not how"): the engine
# source must never be served. Root-anchored, so .well-known/**/*.py is untouched.
/scoring/
/*.py
/dev-server.js
/og-image.build.mjs
/og-image.source.html
/*.sh

# --- Node-only i18n dictionaries for the static SEO generators (pt/es +
# generator-only EN/KO keys). Never loaded by a browser; keep them off the CDN.
/i18n/

# --- deploy/db/agent config, never meant to be public HTTP responses -------
/schema.sql
/wrangler.toml
/.mcp.json
/settings.local.json

# --- other internal source/ops directories (root only): CI scripts (incl. the
# evaluation protocol code), python engines/keepers/adapters, python tests,
# golden fixtures, runtime state dumps, design-critique scratch. None is
# referenced by any served page (verified by the link-integrity gate).
/scripts/
/adapters/
/keeper/
/risk/
/tests/
/fixtures/
/state/
/conflict:/
/.impeccable/

# --- root-level internal docs (NOT the tokens/chains/pools/ko markdown
# twins — those are nested, unaffected by these anchored root patterns) -----
/CLAUDE.md
/DESIGN.md
/PRODUCT.md
/README.md
/SITEMAP.md
/user_journey_diagrams.md
/stakeholder_communication_plan.md

# --- fixtures / scratch ------------------------------------------------------
/test_fixtures/
/test-fixtures/

# --- out-of-scope / never-deployed source dirs (excluding from the deploy
# upload is fine; MODIFYING these dirs is a separate, out-of-scope action) --
/src/
/product-loop-kit/
/product-loop-kit.zip
/.claude/
/.github/
/.agent-reviews/
/docs/
/telegram-bot/
/whatsapp-bot/
/workers/
/edge/
